{"id":"a0b83ca065132609","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point.md","title":"Goldfarb’s One-Sided Fixed-Point Criterion","display":"lem-goldfarb-fixed-point — Goldfarb’s One-Sided Fixed-Point Criterion","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point","aliases":["89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-goldfarb-fixed-point — Goldfarb’s One-Sided Fixed-Point Criterion","depends_on":["[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]]","[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-goldfarb-fixed-point — Goldfarb’s One-Sided Fixed-Point Criterion"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ad8a244f68941668\" href=\"?note=ad8a244f68941668\" title=\"89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality\">89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"71b4f56d6213ff7c\" href=\"?note=71b4f56d6213ff7c\" title=\"89-df-modal-subformula\">89-df-modal-subformula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"437e16026e9e0691\" href=\"?note=437e16026e9e0691\" title=\"89-df-finite-frame-rank\">89-df-finite-frame-rank</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" href=\"?note=b47f1c6b1cd23b5e\" title=\"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel\">89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"0157f8bea9275cf1\" href=\"?note=0157f8bea9275cf1\" title=\"89-thm-gl-soundness\">89-thm-gl-soundness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"f40c827a0ffac0b4\" href=\"?note=f40c827a0ffac0b4\" title=\"89-lem-k4-dotted-box\">89-lem-k4-dotted-box</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"7c3acbd110a662db\" href=\"?note=7c3acbd110a662db\" title=\"89-lem-lob-implies-4\">89-lem-lob-implies-4</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\">\\(p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\)</span> 为定理集。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 为有限 GL 框架秩。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}goldfarb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}goldfarb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 107–108；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>先证明反向未加盒蕴含。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span> 非定理，在有限 GL 反模型取违反它的最小秩世界 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span>。每个后继也满足 dotted-box 前件，故由最小性满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow A\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow A\\)</span>。仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 翻转 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的赋值：模态化使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 不变，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 不含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 也不变，后继的全部真值不变。于是新模型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\">\\(w\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\">\\(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\)</span> 却违反 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\leftrightarrow H\">\\(p\\leftrightarrow H\\)</span>，反驳所给定理，矛盾。\nK4 中 dotted box 的幂等性表明，任何可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+E\\to F\">\\(\\Box^+E\\to F\\)</span> 都提升为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box^+F\">\\(\\Box^+E\\to\\Box^+F\\)</span>：必然化、K 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E\">\\(\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E\\)</span> 足够。分别提升原方向和已证反方向，得到完整等价。GL 包含 K4，所以该提升适用。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality","status":"resolved","id":"ad8a244f68941668","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-subformula","status":"resolved","id":"71b4f56d6213ff7c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-subformula]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-finite-frame-rank","status":"resolved","id":"437e16026e9e0691","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-finite-frame-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel","status":"resolved","id":"b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-gl-finite-countermodel]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-gl-soundness","status":"resolved","id":"0157f8bea9275cf1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-gl-soundness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-k4-dotted-box","status":"resolved","id":"f40c827a0ffac0b4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-dotted-box]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-lob-implies-4","status":"resolved","id":"7c3acbd110a662db","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-lob-implies-4]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(A,p)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\notin\\mathrm{Var}_{\\Box}(H)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}goldfarb\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point}\\vdash\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}\n\\Longrightarrow\n(\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)\\leftrightarrow\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H))\\in\\mathrm{GL}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow H)\\to(p\\leftrightarrow A)","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow A","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"H","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"w","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+(p\\leftrightarrow A)","display":false},{"tex":"p\\leftrightarrow H","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+E\\to F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box^+F","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+E\\to\\Box\\Box^+E","display":false}],"bytes":1875,"backlinks":[{"id":"426d9ae12ef39fe8","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6c6cad39792d5f33","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4ba460c900107e00","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"dc27d1abcea524e3","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-105","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"判据与唯一性：[[89-df-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-bernardi-uniqueness]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-uniqueness]]；[[89-lem-modalized-valuation-locality]] → [[89-lem-goldfarb-fixed-point]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-strong-equivalence]]。"}],"outgoing":["ad8a244f68941668","71b4f56d6213ff7c","437e16026e9e0691","b47f1c6b1cd23b5e","0157f8bea9275cf1","f40c827a0ffac0b4","7c3acbd110a662db"]}